concept:c2014c00733-sch-4-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule(s)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Each Act, and each regulation, that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  (2) The amendment of any regulation under subsection (1) does not prevent the regulation, as so amended, from being amended or repealed by the Governor-General.  (3) To avoid doubt, regulations amended under subsection (1) are taken to still be regulations. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2014C00733  Transitional provisions  Schedule 4 Preliminary  Part 1  Australian Communications and Media Authority (Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Act 2005" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Each Act, and each regulation, that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.  (2) The amendment of any regulation under subsection (1) does not prevent the regulation, as so amended, from being amended or repealed by the Governor-General.  (3) To avoid doubt, regulations amended under subsection (1) are taken to still be regulations. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2014C00733  Transitional provisions  Schedule 4 Preliminary  Part 1  Australian Communications and Media Authority (Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Act 2005"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "92b3a6958fc9ed2cddd56e3b2e836601654802ef2e76c5b2f00b57e7eb72872b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2014c00733-sch-4-sec-3-ss-1 ;
