concept:c2014c00733-sch-4-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Oct 2014"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-4-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "Sch 2 (items 175– 181): 17 Oct 2014 (s  2(1) item 2) —  (a) Subsection 2(1) (item 29) of the Statute Law Revision Act 2007 provides as follows:  (1) Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.  Commencement information Column 1 Column 2 Column 3 Provision(s) Commencement Date/Details" ;
    skos:definition "Sch 2 (items 175– 181): 17 Oct 2014 (s  2(1) item 2) —  (a) Subsection 2(1) (item 29) of the Statute Law Revision Act 2007 provides as follows:  (1) Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.  Commencement information Column 1 Column 2 Column 3 Provision(s) Commencement Date/Details"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cbc47fcf88c75efe11e86d30c53132e2f031e3ea604dc783317bf7b4756a2461" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commencement information for provisions of this Act." ;
